{"item_uid": "學測108-chinese_reading-020", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 108, "year_ce": 2019, "subject_key": "chinese_reading", "subject_zh": "國文（選擇題）", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 20, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據上文，下列甲、乙兩項推斷，正確的是：\n甲、新大陸發現之前，歐洲人的餐桌上不會有玉米、馬鈴薯。\n乙、新大陸發現之後，美洲才開始種植青椒、番茄、四季豆。", "options": {"A": "甲、乙皆正確", "B": "甲正確，乙錯誤", "C": "甲、乙皆無法判斷", "D": "甲無法判斷，乙正確"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "18-21", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 12.0, "B": 60.0, "C": 21.0, "D": 7.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 6.0, "B": 77.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 2.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 19.0, "B": 43.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 12.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 60.0, "p_high": 77.0, "p_low": 43.0, "discrimination": 34.0, "p_quintiles": [81.0, 70.0, 61.0, 51.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
