{"item_uid": "學測108-chinese_reading-023", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 108, "year_ce": 2019, "subject_key": "chinese_reading", "subject_zh": "國文（選擇題）", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 23, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "關於科學工作者和文學藝術工作者的差異，最符合上文觀點的是：", "options": {"A": "文學藝術工作者敬重前輩大師，科學工作者通常不然", "B": "科學工作者追求以「物」取代「人」，文學藝術工作者通常不然", "C": "科學工作者注重「創造物」的客觀考證，文學藝術工作者通常不然", "D": "文學藝術工作者留意「創造者」的創作心靈活動，科學工作者通常不然"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "22-24", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 2.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 75.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 0.0, "B": 4.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 91.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 6.0, "B": 22.0, "C": 18.0, "D": 54.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 75.0, "p_high": 91.0, "p_low": 54.0, "discrimination": 37.0, "p_quintiles": [93.0, 87.0, 80.0, 69.0, 46.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測108-chinese_reading-024", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 108, "year_ce": 2019, "subject_key": "chinese_reading", "subject_zh": "國文（選擇題）", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 24, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "今年是工業革命代表人物瓦特（James Watt）逝世200周年，下列是某高中紀念展覽的\n內容，其中與作者期待參加的「相對論之旅」理念最接近的選項是：\n甲、「瓦特」是國際單位制的功率單位 乙、瓦特是蘇格蘭造船工人之子\n丙、瓦特在格拉斯哥大學開的小修理店 丁、瓦特設計的蒸汽機運轉模型\n戊、瓦特與英格蘭製造商博爾頓長期合作 己、瓦特如何阻止他人獲得專利", "options": {"A": "甲乙丙戊", "B": "乙丙戊己", "C": "甲丁戊己", "D": "乙丙丁己\n- 6 -\n第 7 頁 108年學測\n共 11 頁 國文考科（選擇題）"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "22-24", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 69.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 92.0, "C": 1.0, "D": 6.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 14.0, "B": 39.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 22.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 69.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 39.0, "discrimination": 53.0, "p_quintiles": [94.0, 87.0, 76.0, 57.0, 30.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測108-chinese_reading-025", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 108, "year_ce": 2019, "subject_key": "chinese_reading", "subject_zh": "國文（選擇題）", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 25, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據上文，下列甲、乙兩項關於《牡丹亭》演出的推斷，正確的是：\n甲、因「心境」比「物境」重要，舞臺不必然出現代表男主角柳夢梅的梅樹。\n乙、因「意境」比「實境」重要，杜麗娘的深情不必以服裝和唱作念打表達。", "options": {"A": "甲、乙皆正確", "B": "甲、乙皆錯誤", "C": "甲正確，乙錯誤", "D": "甲錯誤，乙正確"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "25-27", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 22.0, "B": 31.0, "C": 33.0, "D": 14.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 19.0, "B": 28.0, "C": 44.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 24.0, "B": 32.0, "C": 25.0, "D": 19.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 33.0, "p_high": 44.0, "p_low": 25.0, "discrimination": 19.0, "p_quintiles": [48.0, 37.0, 31.0, 27.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測108-chinese_reading-026", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 108, "year_ce": 2019, "subject_key": "chinese_reading", "subject_zh": "國文（選擇題）", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 26, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "上文提及「年齡不再是單點直線的真實數字，反倒是多點如星群散布的生命樣態」，下\n列關於這句話的解說，最適當的是：", "options": {"A": "透過象徵化的表演，演員與角色的生命交織，展現歲月與技藝的淬鍊", "B": "不同年齡層演員相互切磋，突破生理年齡限制，讓戲劇演出發光發熱", "C": "演員實際年齡象徵飽經世事的成熟，由其演出的角色將如星芒般耀眼", "D": "演員能揣摩各種表演藝術，跨越年齡侷限，將實境與物境提升至意境"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "25-27", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 40.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 8.0, "D": 44.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 53.0, "B": 2.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 41.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 28.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 14.0, "D": 44.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 40.0, "p_high": 53.0, "p_low": 28.0, "discrimination": 25.0, "p_quintiles": [57.0, 47.0, 40.0, 33.0, 25.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測108-chinese_reading-027", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 108, "year_ce": 2019, "subject_key": "chinese_reading", "subject_zh": "國文（選擇題）", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 27, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "上文以「我們都是青少年」作為篇名的理由，最可能是：", "options": {"A": "老演員逝去的青春因杜麗娘而被喚醒，觀眾內心的青春悸動也甦醒過來", "B": "舞臺時空虛實相生的效果，讓觀眾得以一代一代延續杜麗娘的青春綺夢", "C": "《牡丹亭》的青春特質不分你我，可藉由戲劇的感染力開拓新的觀眾群", "D": "《牡丹亭》藉杜麗娘還魂，召喚演員與觀眾靈魂裡不曾有過的青春情懷"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "25-27", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 72.0, "B": 14.0, "C": 9.0, "D": 5.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 87.0, "B": 9.0, "C": 2.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 51.0, "B": 20.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 9.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 72.0, "p_high": 87.0, "p_low": 51.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [90.0, 84.0, 76.0, 66.0, 43.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測108-chinese_reading-028", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 108, "year_ce": 2019, "subject_key": "chinese_reading", "subject_zh": "國文（選擇題）", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 28, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據上文，關於羅、李二人歌曲的內容，敘述不適當的是：", "options": {"A": "羅大佑的歌，反映理想主義時代對歷史國族的關切，深沉抑鬱", "B": "李宗盛的歌，往往契入人心，讓聽者的悲喜彷彿都能獲得傾吐", "C": "羅大佑的「大人世界」，把整個時代挑在肩上，省視個人生命內在的惶惑", "D": "李宗盛的「大人世界」，擅長從柴米油鹽的日常中，提煉老於世故的省察"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "28-30", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 11.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 73.0, "D": 9.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 1.0, "C": 92.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 21.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 48.0, "D": 16.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 73.0, "p_high": 92.0, "p_low": 48.0, "discrimination": 44.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 87.0, 78.0, 64.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測108-chinese_reading-029", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 108, "year_ce": 2019, "subject_key": "chinese_reading", "subject_zh": "國文（選擇題）", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 29, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據上文，關於羅、李二人的歌詞創作，敘述最適當的是：", "options": {"A": "二人均銳意經營歌詞的意象結構，直白而不失詩意", "B": "二人均極為在意歌詞與旋律的「咬合」，故精心琢磨", "C": "羅大佑擅長以「校園民歌」的文藝腔，寫作沉鬱滄桑的歌詞，充滿時代感", "D": "李宗盛長於以作論方式寫歌，將邏輯辯證融入詩化的語言中，煽情而輕盈"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "28-30", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "B", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 7.0, "B": 50.0, "C": 15.0, "D": 27.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 73.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 20.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 13.0, "B": 27.0, "C": 27.0, "D": 32.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 50.0, "p_high": 73.0, "p_low": 27.0, "discrimination": 46.0, "p_quintiles": [79.0, 63.0, 51.0, 35.0, 24.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測108-chinese_reading-030", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 108, "year_ce": 2019, "subject_key": "chinese_reading", "subject_zh": "國文（選擇題）", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 30, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "下列羅、李二人歌詞中，最符合上文所謂「歷史國族」情懷的是：", "options": {"A": "黃色的臉孔有紅色的污泥／黑色的眼珠有白色的恐懼／西風在東方唱著悲傷的歌曲", "B": "我所有目光的焦點／在你額頭的兩道弧線／它隱隱約約它若隱若現／襯托你／襯托\n你靦腆的容顏", "C": "不捨你那黑白分明亮亮的眼睛／只是你年紀還小／無從明瞭我的心情／時間不停／\n時間不停／原諒我依然決定遠行", "D": "烏溜溜的黑眼珠和你的笑臉／怎麼也難忘記你容顏的轉變／輕飄飄的舊時光就這麼\n溜走／轉頭回去看看已匆匆數年"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "28-30", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "A", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 79.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 6.0, "D": 12.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 93.0, "B": 0.0, "C": 3.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 61.0, "B": 7.0, "C": 10.0, "D": 21.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 79.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 61.0, "discrimination": 32.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 90.0, 83.0, 73.0, 54.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測108-chinese_reading-031", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 108, "year_ce": 2019, "subject_key": "chinese_reading", "subject_zh": "國文（選擇題）", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 31, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "依據上文，對於越巫形象的描寫，最適當的是：", "options": {"A": "仗恃靈力，脅制鄉里", "B": "惡行易改，心魔難除", "C": "設壇召魅，作法自斃", "D": "無知自是，誤人害己"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "31-32", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "D", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 6.0, "B": 12.0, "C": 11.0, "D": 71.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 3.0, "B": 3.0, "C": 4.0, "D": 89.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 9.0, "B": 23.0, "C": 19.0, "D": 47.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 71.0, "p_high": 89.0, "p_low": 47.0, "discrimination": 42.0, "p_quintiles": [92.0, 84.0, 75.0, 63.0, 39.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
{"item_uid": "學測108-chinese_reading-032", "sitting": "regular", "exam_system": "學測", "year_roc": 108, "year_ce": 2019, "subject_key": "chinese_reading", "subject_zh": "國文（選擇題）", "curriculum": "99課綱及以前", "number": 32, "join_excluded": false, "part": null, "stem": "關於上文的寫作手法與文意，敘述最適當的是：", "options": {"A": "以「相去各里所」暗示少年們對越巫心存畏怯，彼此守望照應", "B": "以「即旋其角」、「角不能成音」、「手慄氣懾不能角」描寫越巫因又懼又急而法\n力愈加減弱", "C": "以「且角且走」、「角墜；振其鈴，既而鈴墜，惟大叫以行」表現越巫從試圖自欺\n到心神失控的狼狽", "D": "以「行聞履聲及葉鳴谷響，亦皆以為鬼號」凸顯越巫仍想藉由周遭聲響研判鬼的行\n蹤，求得活命機會"}, "option_source": null, "group_id": "31-32", "group_passage": null, "section": null, "keys": "C", "item_flags": [], "extracted_by": "pdf", "multi_select": false, "option_dist_T": {"A": 3.0, "B": 15.0, "C": 77.0, "D": 4.0}, "option_dist_H": {"A": 1.0, "B": 6.0, "C": 93.0, "D": 1.0}, "option_dist_L": {"A": 8.0, "B": 25.0, "C": 57.0, "D": 10.0}, "omit_rate": 0.0, "p_value": 77.0, "p_high": 93.0, "p_low": 57.0, "discrimination": 36.0, "p_quintiles": [95.0, 89.0, 82.0, 70.0, 49.0], "hl_definition": "top_bottom_33pct"}
